    "description": "Objective\n\nSeparate the conflated Fraud/Invalid reason into distinct Archive and Fraud reason sets.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Split Fraud/Invalid Reason into two picklists per the outcome of the open question in the Design & User Stories doc\n\n* Rename Fraud / Invalid Other Reason to Archived/Fraud Other Reason\n\n* Migrate existing values\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Archive reasons and Fraud reasons are independently maintained\n\n* No existing data is orphaned by the split\n\nDependencies\n\nSEQUENCING CRITICAL: BUILD-52 (Archive flow) and BUILD-53 (Fraud flow) both consume these picklists. Do this FIRST or both flows get built twice.\n\nOpen Questions\n\n* Final value sets for each picklist require Wagertech confirmation.\n\nEstimate: S · \\~4h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — items 9.1 and 9.2.",
